{
  "about": "Party window clicks (issue #482): the bar without a party and in one (agency, setup, lock, create or invite and leave from x 5, 26 apart); a member's Invite tells only the leader invites; the leader's menu on a member (mail, 1:1 chat, expel, assign) and Expel's question; the lock stops Leave and the menu; a double click on a row opens the 1:1 chat; the second, an Acolyte, puts Heal on the first's row, and as a Swordman Bash isn't taken; Expel removes the second; Leave hands the party to the second first.",
